# SPDX-License-Identifier: PMPL-1.0-or-later
# AI Manifest for rescript-ecosystem monorepo
# Version: 1.0.0

## Identity
name: rescript-ecosystem
type: monorepo
description: Consolidated monorepo for 26 hyperpolymath ReScript packages
author: Jonathan D.A. Jewell <j.d.a.jewell@open.ac.uk>
license: PMPL-1.0-or-later

## Structure
# All packages live under packages/ organized by group:
#   packages/core/       - Foundation libraries (5 packages)
#   packages/web/        - Web frameworks and servers (6 packages)
#   packages/bindings/   - Service and library bindings (6 packages)
#   packages/ffi/        - Foreign function interface bridges (4 packages)
#   packages/tooling/    - Developer tools and codemods (7 packages)

## Critical Invariants
# 1. SCM files ONLY in .machine_readable/ (never in repo root)
# 2. Each package retains its own rescript.json
# 3. Do NOT merge asdf-rescript-plugin into this repo
# 4. Do NOT merge zotero-rescript-templater into this repo
# 5. License is PMPL-1.0-or-later throughout

## Build
# Use `just` command runner from repo root
# Individual packages: just build <group>/<package>
# All packages: just build-all
